    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/cleaning-services-agent/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Cleaning Services Agent Theme is a versatile and professional tool designed for cleaning agencies, janitorial services, maid services, housekeeping businesses, residential cleaning companies, commercial cleaning providers, industrial cleaning services, and specialized cleaning businesses. Tailored for companies offering house cleaning, office cleaning, deep cleaning, green cleaning, carpet cleaning, upholstery cleaning, pressure washing, sanitising services, move-in/move-out cleaning, post-construction cleaning, and customized cleaning packages, this theme helps showcase all services with a polished and trustworthy online presence. Its sleek and modern design features an intuitive layout with customizable sections such as “About Us” to highlight your team’s expertise and “Testimonials” to build credibility with real customer reviews. High-quality image and video galleries allow you to present cleaning techniques, tools, and before-and-after results, engaging visitors with impactful visuals. Packed with features to enhance functionality and user experience, the theme includes Call to Action buttons, responsive design for seamless browsing on all devices, SEO-friendly code, and fast loading times to improve search engine rankings. WooCommerce integration enables agencies to offer cleaning packages, sell cleaning supplies, or manage service bookings online, while translation readiness and social media integration expand accessibility and engagement, making it the ideal solution for growing cleaning service businesses."
    },
